# This repo's tracked files are stored with LF line endings. Pin these two
# files to LF on checkin/checkout regardless of platform/core.autocrlf, since
# editing them on Windows was introducing CRLF/LF churn warnings in `git diff`
# (see docs/SPEC.md hardening notes). Scoped narrowly rather than repo-wide so
# other already-checked-out files are left untouched.
app/models.py text eol=lf
requirements.txt text eol=lf
